{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154910/extras/image.png?t=1746524187\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SERK: Chaos City Delivery</strong><br>I created this game to express the daily struggles of people living in chaotic cities around the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're on your way, then suddenly\u2014bam! A car or tuk-tuk swerves toward you with no signal, no warning.<br>In this city, drivers follow their own rules... or none at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll need to rely on every camera angle the game provides \u2014 because trust me, you'll need it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t expect an easy ride. This game is meant to be harsh, frustrating, and painfully real.<br>The message is simple: we need proper traffic systems in these cities \u2014 too many people get hurt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No more pain. Just chaos, challenge, and a dash of fun.<br>The game is currently in demo phase \u2014 your feedback is more than welcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154910/extras/scoreUpdate_00_00_00-00_00_30.gif?t=1746524187\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154910/extras/image2.png?t=1746524187\" /> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3154910?t=1746524187","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3154910?t=1746524187","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154910/6b01c2cc299c09d7ba6047bb2fa7a830d3b533b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746524187","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154910/6b01c2cc299c09d7ba6047bb2fa7a830d3b53